#
# This is a FLOOR, not an equality. Adding tests must never fail the gate.
# Dropping below it must, because a suite that silently shrinks from 283 to 12
# exits 0 and prints the same green as a suite that did its job.
#
# Lowering this number is allowed and sometimes correct. Do it in the SAME
# commit that removes the tests, and say why in the message.
